# Budget differential: taxes at 0 and 1 starve the treasury (auto budget gives up,
# the budget is scaled back, funds run out), then the player recovers the city.
# Run by scripts/compare-budget.sh.
0 budget 100 100 100
0 tax 0
400 tax 1
800 budget 100 100 100
1000 budget 0 0 0
1200 tax 0
1400 budget 100 100 100
1800 tax 4
2200 budget 100 100 0
2400 tax 20
2700 budget 50 50 50
2950 tax 0
